  "differencesFromCapstoneDriver": [
    "stream-json --verbose output instead of json, for the tool trace; the result fields are the same",
    "--setting-sources project, so user-level plugins, hooks and CLAUDE.md do not reach the subject",
    "parent Claude Code session variables removed from the subject environment",
    "boot check runs as node harness/gate/check-boot.mjs after the run, restored from the launching commit",
    "stage 0 and the human review stop, in the schematic condition only",
    "the condition settings are also written to .claude/settings.json, because this substrate carries an armed project settings file and the capstone substrate carried none",
    "--strict-mcp-config, so only .mcp.json servers load, and MCP_TIMEOUT=180000 for the npx cold start",
    "Haiku 5.5 pinned by full model ID; the capstone ran Haiku 4.5 by alias",
    "series 2: seal and layout counted on templates expanded with their stylesheet @apply utilities, plus the bem family (harness/bem-house-style-spec.md)",
    "series 5: stages named in schematic.stagePrompts read the mod prompt that prescribes the slice generator, not the capstone prompt (Decision G1); every prompt sha256 is in meta.prompts",
    "series 5: the schematic condition runs harness/gate/s4-schematic.settings.json (gate-on plus route-to-generator, Decision G4)"
  ],
